# 16. C1 — reuse L2's atomic licensing machinery

Canonical commentary:

```text
C1
```

must remain passage-local.

So use the same generic verifier kernel:

```text
C1
↓
atomic claims
↓
SOURCE + L2 + L200
↓
licensed / unsupported / contradicted
```

plus native:

```text
LOCALITY
BOUNDARY
TECHNICAL_TERM
AUTHOR_ATTRIBUTION
```

RefChecker/FActScore-style checking becomes reusable infrastructure here.

No need to build a second commentary-specific semantic model from scratch.

