# 17. THEME / ESSAY / EDUCATION

Same principle again.

You already have Agent 1's:

```text
SentenceEvidenceAudit
epistemic ceiling
dependency graph
```

So use generic atomic-support machinery underneath.

### Theme

ML clustering can nominate members.

But:

```text
cluster ≠ theme
```

Verification:

```text
membership precision
role correctness
theme proposition licensed by members
counterexamples retained
```

### Essay

Every substantive sentence resolves to upstream evidence.

Agent 1 already has the best native mechanism here.

External factuality methods can supplement it, not replace it.

### Education

Check:

```text
did simplification preserve the essay's actual claims?
```

Same atomic licensing kernel.

